{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16791","headline":"奉和圣制重阳旦日百寮曲江宴示怀 · 崔元翰","name":"奉和圣制重阳旦日百寮曲江宴示怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶圣覩昌期，受恩慙弱质。\n幸逢良宴会，况是清秋日。\n远岫对壶觞，澄澜映簪绂。\n炮羔备丰膳，集凤调鸣律。\n薄劣厕英豪，欢娱忘衰疾。\n平臯行雁下，曲渚双凫出。\n沙岸菊开花，霜枝果垂实。\n天文见成象，帝念资勤恤。\n探道得玄珠，斋心居特室。\n岂如横汾唱，其事徒骄逸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔元翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}